### Create an issue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/issues/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Issue 2",
    "description": "Description 1",
    "repository": "6a05994149f210478aa6b38d",
    "assignees":["6a04abf3a3d4a83ffd85038d"]
}

### Delete an issue
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/issues/issue/:issueId
